{"synopsis":"25 tahun setelah terbukanya Gerbang Neraka umat manusia telah musnah kecuali satu orang\nNamgung yang kembali tiga hari sebelum Gerbang Neraka dibuka setelah menyelesaikan misi\nbersumpah untuk melindungi putrinya yang bersatu kembali Dia mulai melahap hadiah dari 8 bintang bela diri yang dipilih oleh Delapan Fase yang mirip dengan dewa\nSetelah duduk di antara Delapan bintang bela diri Namgung menyelesaikan setiap festival karnaval yang akan datang dengan kenangannya sebelum kembali\nDan saat dia bersiap menghadapi halhal yang akan datang dengan mengumpulkan sekutu dan tumbuh lebih kuat\ndia mulai mengalami peristiwa yang belum pernah dia hadapi bahkan dirinya sendiri","alternative_title":"회귀한 아포칼립스의 폭군","author":"Kim Dokbae, Lee Hyoungsuk","artist":"Lee Mundong, Pebaragi","chapters":[{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"82f15854-d962-42e2-a2e1-b43ad5d76f94","date":"2025-07-08","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"a633ef4e-9d46-4989-97e5-d29bb24e535e","date":"2025-06-20","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"494db41f-f392-4cdc-b016-45cc614b3a78","date":"2025-06-13","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"d8dadb70-f7b1-418b-9501-e4c8414bd999","date":"2025-06-06","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"a095977c-5a0d-401c-8839-236d250de083","date":"2025-05-30","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"247269ec-3967-4db1-b669-4b992df286f2","date":"2025-05-23","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"67e35733-1f9d-4248-bf74-dc52d405ca30","date":"2025-05-16","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"a9bd1984-f04b-4b2c-8f2d-500363dba0d1","date":"2025-05-09","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"aa0a7427-6e19-48cf-985f-b649adabc159","date":"2025-03-10","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"777105df-1b68-4a0d-9159-bbb88e43f85b","date":"2025-03-10","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"f2cfc18d-93b8-442e-893b-fa1a9aa0b163","date":"2025-03-10","ima